---
description: Keep Cleanora as one deployable modular monolith with isolated capabilities.
globs: "src/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Build one deployable application composed of cohesive business modules.
- Communicate through explicit public contracts.
- Share infrastructure only through controlled adapters.
- Do not add microservice networking, service discovery, or distributed deployment assumptions.
- Avoid premature event-bus complexity; use internal domain/application events only when they reduce coupling.
- Keep behavior and persistence access owned by the responsible module.
- Release 3 infrastructure does not automatically split the monolith.
